  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank GCFF 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GCFF is to support middle income host countries by providing concessional financing and improved coordination for development projects addressing the impact of the influx of large numbers of refugees. The Facility&#x2019;s initial focus is Jordan and Lebanon, which are currently experiencing one of the world&#x2019;s most acute refugee crises. Other middle-income countries that face future refugee emergencies can be eligible for support. The GCFF is designed to quickly address these crises wherever they arise.

This is a core contribution to the GCFF designated through the &apos;Global&apos; funding window</narrative>
  </description>
